  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/12290 added a test for a synchronous `beforeunload` event. Chromium and Gecko pass it. However, the test is invalid as of #6315 (navigate rewrite). It also seems somewhat undesirable to not fire this event from a task. Shall we change the test and get Chromium and Gecko to align or do we need to make this work specification-wise somehow?\n\n@jakearchibald @domfarolino @smaug---- @farre thoughts?",
